  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposals include operational development which cannot be achieved under Class MA of Schedule 2, Part 3 of the Town and Country Planning General Permitted Development (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "The proposed development, a 1 bedroom 1 person 2 storey dwellinghouse, is not a combination of accommodation supported within Table 1 of the Nationally Described Space Standard. Accordingly, the proposal would not comply with the Nationally Described Space Standard, contrary to Article 3 - Permitted Development, 3, (9A)(b) of the Town and Country Planning General Permitted Development (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "Insufficient evidence has been provided that the proposed living room habitable space would receive adequate access to natural light, contrary to MA.2(2)(f) Class MA of Schedule 2, Part 3 of the Town and Country Planning General Permitted Development (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
  ],
